# Ordering Platform

## What This Is
Multi-tenant restaurant ordering SaaS. HavaJava 671 Café is the first tenant.

## Tech Stack
- **Backend:** Rails 7 API-only, Ruby 3.3+, PostgreSQL
- **Frontend:** React 19, Vite, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS v4, Framer Motion
- **Payments:** Stripe
- **State:** Zustand
- **Icons:** Lucide React

## Key Architecture
- Multi-tenant: everything scoped to Restaurant by slug
- API routes: `/api/v1/restaurants/:slug/...`
- Brand tokens: CSS custom properties loaded from API
- Modifier groups: flexible system for ALL item customization

## Design Rules (NON-NEGOTIABLE)
- NO emoji in UI — use Lucide React icons ONLY
- Mobile-first, 44px minimum touch targets
- Framer Motion for all animations
- Brand tokens via CSS custom properties (never hardcode colors)
- Follow Shimizu Technology design system

## Code Style
- Ruby: Rails conventions, thin controllers, model validations
- TypeScript: strict mode, no `any`
- Components: functional, small, focused
- Files: kebab-case for CSS, PascalCase for components
